            "review_title": "Review at Chi Mac Korea",
            "review_text": "Kyle S\nVancouver, Canada16 contributions\n0\nWaaaay overpriced.\nMar 2019 • Couples\nWe ordered fried chicken (HALF) and sweet and sour chiceken bites. Plus two beers. 350,000d. \n\nFried chicken had a tasty batter but there was so little chicken on the bones. More like bones with chicken. The sweet and sour chicken was better but not much flavour. We asked for hot sauce to improve it.\n\nNo way is this place worth what they are charging. Wouldn't recommend or go back again.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 5, 2019",
